(card "exp:G-R2-3_luoyangchan_nocap" :type "experiment"
  :subj "exp:G-R2-3_luoyangchan_nocap"
  :body "---\nnav: 31\ntype: experiment\nid: G-R2-3_luoyangchan_nocap\nshort_name: luoyangchan_nocap\ntitle: \"G-R2-3 — 洛阳铲 solo, baseline_max_avg = +inf (no cap diagnostic)\"\narc: 260516a\nteam: g\nround: r2\nparent_arc: \"[[arcs/260516a]]\"\nparent_lineage: \"[[lineages/arc_260516a__team_g__source_swap]]\"\ntrain_nav: 1.0296\ntrain_trade_count: 123\ntrain_win_rate: 0.5203\ntrain_sharpe: 0.7968\ntrain_max_drawdown: -0.019\nval_nav_mean: 1.0026\nval_nav_sigma: 0.0084\nval_window_count: 11\ntest_nav: 1.0465\ntest_trade_count: 11\ntest_sharpe: 6.2969\ntest_win_rate: 0.7273\ntest_max_drawdown: -0.0065\nanchor_train_nav: 2.1882\nanchor_test_nav: 1.2486\nstatus: demoted\noutcome: test_fail\nchampion: false\noverfit_score: 0\nleak_audit: clean\naxis: [source_swap]\npast_only_window_days: null\nwarmup_required: null\ncreated: 2026-05-17T01:30:00\nlast_updated: 2026-05-17T05:09:00\ntags: [arc/260516a, team/g, round/r2, axis/source_swap, status/demoted, outcome/test_fail, leak/clean, size/large]\n---\n\n# G-R2-3 — 洛阳铲 + NO cap (diagnostic)\n\n> **TL;DR** —— diagnostic 极限：完全去掉 baseline_max_avg cap。trade_count 跳到 123 (vs R1-1 27)，但 **win 52% sharpe 0.80 max_dd 1.9%** —— sample 终于够了，但 NAV 1.03。 **明确证伪 \"cap 是洛阳铲 bottleneck\" 假设**。test 11 笔同 G-R1-1 (因为洛阳铲 test 数据有限)。\n\n## 假设 (Hypothesis)\n- diagnostic：cap=+inf 让所有 raw signal 全过 pipeline, 直接测试 source 本身的 alpha。\n- 实测：win 52% near random, sharpe 0.80 极低 → 洛阳铲 source 几乎无 alpha。\n\n## 实现 (Implementation)\n- 同 G-R2-1, `baseline_max_avg=+inf`. 152 raw → 186 post-ETF-bl → 186 post-cap.\n\n## Past-only window 处理\n- 无 rolling. `#leak/clean`.\n\n## 结果 (Results)\n| | NAV | Trades | Sharpe | Win | MaxDD |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Train | 1.0296 | 123 | 0.80 | 52.0% | -1.90% |\n| Val (11w) | 1.0026 ± 0.008 | - | - | - | - |\n| Test | 1.0465 | 11 | 6.30 | 72.7% | -0.65% |\n| **Δ test NAV vs anchor** | **-0.202 (FAIL)** | -9 | -0.85 | -2.3pp | -0.12pp |\n\n## 风险 & overfit 嫌疑\n- overfit_score = 0; 是 diagnostic 故意跑.\n\n## Lineage（双链网）\n- **derived_from**: [[arc_260516a__team_g__G-R2-1__luoyangchan_cap26M]]\n- **diagnostic_for**: [[arc_260516a__team_g__G-R1-1__luoyangchan_solo]] (证 cap 不是 bottleneck)\n- **builds against**: [[arc_260516a__team_anchor__anchor_g2__baseline]]\n\n## Reports\n- `team_g/output/cross_round_leaderboard_nav.csv` (G-R2-3)\n- `cross_team_test_nav_ranking_v2.csv` (G-R2-3 test 1.046)\n- [[arc_260516a__reporter_20260517_0547]]\n\n## Notes / 下次迭代\n- **decisive diagnostic**: cap=+inf 仍 NAV 1.03 → 洛阳铲 source itself 无 alpha。Team G 据此停掉 source-swap axis. 下次别再 single-source swap。\n- 真正路线在 [[arc_260516a__team_g__G-R1-3__cross_source_consensus_strict]] 类 ensemble。\n"
  :path "experiments/arc_260516a__team_g__G-R2-3__luoyangchan_nocap.md"
